<title>NEW ZEALAND: Richina sets div, changes balance date.</title>
<headline>Richina sets div, changes balance date.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Richina Pacific Ltd said on Wednesday the strike price for shares issued in its Dividend Reinvestment Plan in respect of the interim dividend payable on December 12, 1996, was NZ 44.21 cents per share.</p>
<p>The board has agreed, subject to IRD consent, to adopt December 31 as Richina Pacific's annual balance date starting this year.</p>
<p>--Wellington Newsroom (64 4) 4734746</p>
</text>
